---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
    title="Purchasing of Items & Equipment - Omagh Harriers AC"
    description="Purchasing Policy"
>
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-r from-black to-gray-900 py-16">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="mb-6">
        <a
            href="/policies"
            class="inline-flex items-center text-amber hover:text-yellow-400 transition-colors mb-4"
        >
          <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-2" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M10 19l-7-7m0 0l7-7m-7 7h18"/>
          </svg>
          Back to Policies
        </a>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-white mb-4">Purchasing of Items & Equipment</h1>
      <p class="text-xl text-gray-300">
        Purchasing Policy
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <section class="py-16 bg-white">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
        <!-- Objective -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Objective</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6">This policy establishes clear and efficient procedures for purchasing goods and services on behalf of
            Omagh Harriers A.C. to ensure transparency, accountability, and prudent financial management.</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Procedure -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Procedure for Requesting Purchases</h3>
          <ol class="list-decimal pl-6 space-y-4 text-gray-700">
            <li><strong>Initial Discussion</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>Any member wishing for the club to purchase an item of equipment should initially discuss the request
                  with their relevant coach i.e. Junior Coach, Senior Coach, Track &amp; Field Coach.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Request Submission</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>Members intending to make purchases on behalf of the club must submit a written request to [<em>Omagh
                  Harriers Email TBC</em>] addressed to the Committee, detailing the items, purpose, specifications, and
                  cost. Requests should be submitted at least fourteen days before the anticipated purchase date.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Approval Process</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>The committee will review and decide on purchase requests at the next committee meeting or within
                  seven days of submission, whichever is sooner. Any necessary clarifications will be sought promptly, and
                  decisions will be made by majority vote.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Quotes Requirement</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>To secure value for money, for purchases exceeding &pound;200 two quotes must be obtained. Quotes must
                  accompany the purchase request.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Receipt Management</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>All receipts for purchases must be provided to the committee within 14 days of delivery of the item
                  purchased for their retention. Receipts will be reviewed during financial audits, and the committee is
                  responsible for ensuring accurate documentation and secure storage.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Storage of Purchased Equipment</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>The item purchased must immediately be placed in storage in one of the Omagh Harriers A.C. storage
                  containers.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Urgent Purchases</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>The person making the urgent request must demonstrate the reason for the urgency. The committee will
                  expedite its decision-making as far as possible while adhering to principles of transparency and
                  cost-effectiveness.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
            <li><strong>Omagh Half Marathon Event</strong>:
              <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 text-gray-700 mt-2">
                <li>The Omagh Half Marathon Sub Committee follows a separate purchasing process, due to the high volume of
                  items, tight time constraints and unexpected circumstances, that necessitate prompt decision-making and
                  actions.
                </li>
              </ul>
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>

        <!-- Review and Compliance -->
        <div class="mb-12">
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4 text-gray-900">Review and Compliance</h3>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">This policy will be reviewed annually to ensure its relevance and effectiveness. Compliance will be
            monitored by the committee to uphold sound financial practices.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">This streamlined policy supports
            timely, transparent, and responsible purchasing decisions for Omagh Harriers Athletic Club.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-3">Members are encouraged to comply with these procedures to facilitate efficient operations.</p>
          <p class="text-gray-700 mb-6"><strong>Approved
            by</strong>: Omagh Harriers A.C. Committee<br/><strong>Date</strong>: December 2024</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Logo -->
        <div class="mt-12 text-center">
          <figure><img
              src="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-8.png?w=408"
              sizes="(max-width: 408px) 100vw, 408px"
              srcset="https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-8.png 408w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-8.png?w=150 150w, https://omaghharriers.wordpress.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/omagh-harriers_black-8.png?w=300 300w"
              alt="" width="408" height="160"
          /></figure>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
